<title>USA: Conroe, Texas won by First Southwest.</title>
<headline>Conroe, Texas won by First Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest Co. said it won $3.500 million of Conroe, Texas, general obligation limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1996 A, with a net interest cost of 5.10922 percent.</p>
</text>
